codex
I’m going to prototype a more substantial `dim=128` no-mask path: after layer norm, a Triton kernel will do the five hidden projections and directly write packed left/right plus out-gate logits. This attempts to remove the large intermediate projection tensor and the packing pass, while leaving the expensive contraction on cuBLAS.
