For `N=768`, `128x64` remains about as good as the larger alternatives; the odd `256x64`/4 result is pathological and won’t be used. I’m waiting for the sweep to finish and will only specialize `N=256`.
diff --git a/submission.py b/submission.py
index a55967ecab705befdd2ce61cfbacc0c84392daab..9b3b7153d38c69abf8a0a5c4ca0cdfcb641c21e6
