codex
I’m trying one more wide-channel idea for masked cases: compute out-gate for all rows, but compute left/right projections only for rows where the mask is 1, then scatter into zero-filled packed matrices. This trades projection FLOPs for nonzero/gather/scatter overhead, so it needs measurement.
